Z||000011||Tigger||11-29-2000||09:46 PM||||I'm Tigger, That's T-I-double-Geh-Er  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I have no problems with you hang'in around PBS.  Actually I think it's pretty cool, and the way it looks you've already gained a lot of respect around here, including mine.<P>Anyway, to kinda introduce myself, I've been into Fiero's for the past few years, bought this one about a year and a half ago...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/before1.gif"> <BR>lots of work and a year later...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/tiggerside.gif"> <BR>yep, that's the same car.<P>I don't know much about MR2's, unfortunately most are pretty ragged up here.  All I gota say, your's has got to be the best one I've ever seen.||||reg||14
Z||000012||william_thorniii||11-29-2000||10:02 PM||||GTB,<P>Who can forget our once "bummed out computer support guy" who has now moved on to greener pastures.  Hey Bastard, is your hair still blue?  That is the accent color I am going for on my ride.  <P>Tigger,<P>It is amazing how much your 84 looked like a Mr. "2" with those Toyota knock-off rims.  <P>PBS,<P>Oh yeah... A word of advice.  Don't fu*k with Stimpy.  In the words of Batboy, "Stimpy, you are a lightning rod."<P>William T. Thorn, III ||||reg||13
Z||000013||PearlBlueSoul||11-29-2000||11:43 PM||||Hehe...I'd imagine.  I'd also suggest not doing the same to me.  I'm very knowledgeable about MR2s.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  no harshness implied, just sayin'.  I know my sheeat. hehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  <P>also, those wheels are off a Grand Am, correct me if I'm wrong.  what wheels on a Toyota have you seen that look like that?  only 3 spoke kinda deal I can think of are the stock MR2 wheels.<BR><P>------------------<BR>1987 Toyota MR2 N/A 5 speed<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.atlantamr2s.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.atlantamr2s.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/darionscard</A>  <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/darionscard/Thumb.jpg">       <BR><B>Notable mods:</B>  Sus tech springs and sway bars, Toyota strut tower brace, KYB strut inserts, HKS exhaust, NGK plugs/wires, Momo Racer wheels (14x6), Custom intake, Kenwood 12" speaker in front trunk, Jensen amp.||||reg||1
