Z||000017||DaRkLoRD||11-30-2000||12:24 AM||||What, I'm not important enough for the list??  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> j/k!<P>I have to admit, I loved the response to the ricer question too..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> That's one more thing most of us have in common.. hehe.. I'm happy to report I've never seen a riced out MR2.. though I have seen a few fieros that were really pushing it.. LOL..<P>It'd be interesting to have a mid-engined sportscar club, composed of both fieros *and* MR2s.. such a club could go a long way towards making any rivalries between the owners just playful fun.. (sorry if that's a crazy idea I sure got a lot of those, eh??) but I'd probably join such a club given the opportunity..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||10
